// EXPECT ERROR: nonlocal 'd' does not resolve to an outer variable
// BUG-077 回归（负测试）：nonlocal 目标须为外层变量须编译期干净拒绝。
// 此前自举 lambda 捕获收集对 `nonlocal name;` 不校验目标是否为外层变量 →
// `nonlocal d`（d 是 lambda 参数）静默建 cell → codegen 取外层 cell 得 ptr
// 当 i32 → opt 崩（"%t54 defined with type 'ptr' but expected 'i32'"）。
// 镜像 C++ capture 解析（"does not resolve to an outer variable"）+
// visitNonlocalStmt（"nonlocal: undeclared variable 'X'"）。
import env;

class T2 {
    action:
        @constructor T2() {
            (int) -> int f = (int d) => {
                nonlocal d;
                return d;
            };
        }
}
int main(){return 0;}
